{
  "_readme": "Fixture for the formatter's unit rule. One collection, four FLOATs, one per scope case the rule has to tell apart: GAP + WIDTH_HEIGHT (a dimension, px), FONT_WEIGHT (a bare number), ALL_SCOPES (the Figma default) and [] (scoped to nothing). The last two carry no unit, so the formatter has to refuse them rather than print a unitless number that any length property reading it treats as invalid.",
